stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Check1: body read (413/400 return before any decision, unlogged by design)
  Check1 --> Refused: ensureWritable() fails
  Check1 --> Inspect: log ok
  Refused --> [*]: 503 audit_log_unavailable, nothing forwarded
  Inspect --> Logged: reject() / block -> write(upstreamStatus null)
  Inspect --> Check2: forward-original / forward-redacted
  Check2 --> Refused: ensureWritable() fails
  Check2 --> Fetch: log ok
  Fetch --> Logged: fetch throws (deadline or unreachable) -> write(error)
  Fetch --> Streaming: headers received, clearTimeout
  Streaming --> Streaming: chunk / usage chunk
  Streaming --> Write: upstream end or client close (pipe swallows abort)
  Write --> Logged: append ok, usage undefined unless seen (ADR 0012)
  Write --> Counted: append throws (log broke after Check2)
  Counted --> [*]: logWriteFailures++, stderr event, no write after end
  Logged --> [*]: exactly one record (ADR 0009)
